    "body": "I agree, and I didn’t miss that feedback. This change explicitly sets the “include shadow roots” flag to “deny”, so that XHR cannot be used to parse DSD content. Without this change to XHR, it will allow DSD parsing. So effectively, this **is** “no change”.",
